WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
What are you doing?

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Nothing.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
It's three in the morning.

4
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Why the hell are you building a pyramid in my living room?

5
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
It's a trust-building exercise.

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Trust?

7
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
What do you know about trust?

8
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
This pyramid...

9
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
it's gonna fall.

10
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
It's gonna come crumbling down because everything does.

11
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
And you are all gonna get hurt.

12
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Okay, time for bed.

13
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Everything's okay, Mrs. Lopez.

14
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Just a little upset.

15
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.000
It's a great pyramid, really it is.

16
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
And you did it without any fat girls on the bottom.

17
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
I'm very impressed.

